Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The regex_amxx.dll H9 shipped before, from the reTS AMX Mod X build (1.10.0-manual):
326144 bytes, SHA256 C0A6FDC7CD933355B47C80FDF1A7FDE21602D0B5ED829CF6B1D200522E02D354,
kept as regex_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file. To go back, copy that over regex_amxx.dll.

On servers of 32 slots or fewer nothing changes: the tables are longer, and every loop and
bound in them still stops at the server's maxplayers.
